{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20074",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 4.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.66,
      "end_seconds": 10.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.46,
      "end_seconds": 25.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.44,
      "text": "Honestly, it's being very thirsty, and my family pushed me to come. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.4,
      "end_seconds": 30.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.19,
      "end_seconds": 35.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "For about a year, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.13,
      "end_seconds": 41.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Okay, how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.86,
      "end_seconds": 60.18,
      "duration_seconds": 18.32,
      "text": "I'd call it severe. As for passing a lot of urine, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About passing a lot of urine, mostly severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.98,
      "end_seconds": 66.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, fruity smelling breath, abdominal pain or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.36,
      "end_seconds": 71.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.01,
      "end_seconds": 80.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.04,
      "end_seconds": 83.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.0,
      "end_seconds": 86.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.67,
      "end_seconds": 91.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Actually, no, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.6,
      "end_seconds": 112.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.57,
      "end_seconds": 118.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.74,
      "end_seconds": 126.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "I follow. Right, so high blood pressure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.45,
      "end_seconds": 141.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.97,
      "end_seconds": 145.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.5,
      "end_seconds": 149.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.05,
      "end_seconds": 151.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.71,
      "end_seconds": 160.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Right, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.88,
      "end_seconds": 184.31,
      "duration_seconds": 18.43,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. My husband and I live above the shop. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.37,
      "end_seconds": 191.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Okay, can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.38,
      "end_seconds": 204.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.7,
      "end_seconds": 228.17,
      "duration_seconds": 12.47,
      "text": "Okay: height 167 centimetres, pressure 161 over 93. And respiratory rate 16, pulse 81, temperature is 36.8 degrees, weight 56 kilos, BMI works out to 20.1."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.74,
      "end_seconds": 234.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.73,
      "end_seconds": 235.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.41,
      "end_seconds": 238.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.22,
      "end_seconds": 259.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "Your fingerprick sugar here is high, and your feet have good pulses and normal feeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.44,
      "end_seconds": 267.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "So, good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.62,
      "end_seconds": 307.72,
      "duration_seconds": 22.1,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, my working impression is symptoms that point to newly developed type 2 diabetes. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. It could also be an overactive thyroid, so we'll keep that open. I'll request a fasting blood sugar, it'll help with thirst and polyuria."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.96,
      "end_seconds": 311.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Well, that's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.31,
      "end_seconds": 316.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I want a urine test done, that's for polyuria."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.56,
      "end_seconds": 319.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.86,
      "end_seconds": 358.35,
      "duration_seconds": 37.49,
      "text": "I'm prescribing metformin, 500 milligrams, once a day with food, long term. It's for high blood sugar. Cut right down on sugary drinks and keep water with you. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I'll also refer you to the diabetes educator. The thing that would worry me is if you are vomiting or feel confused. If that happens, go to emergency. Book a review after the blood results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.24,
      "end_seconds": 368.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.89,
      "end_seconds": 375.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}